# Sanar, Innovative First-Year: "For each of those colors, you may exile a card of that color from among the revealed cards"
# (CR 701.20, 207.2c). Sanar is blue and red, so X is 2. On turn 3 the draw takes the Island and the trigger reveals Lightning
# Bolt, an Island and Burst Lightning: the second nonland card, which ends the reveal, so Chain Lightning below it is not
# revealed and can't be exiled. Blue has no card among them and asks nothing; red offers the Bolt and Burst Lightning for
# one exile only (taking both is refused), never the Island. Bot1 exiles Burst Lightning and casts it, unkicked, at Bot2,
# for 2 damage, the Bolt shuffled back with the rest of the library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Sanar, Innovative First-Year
Island x4
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Burst Lightning
Chain Lightning
Island x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

